  message: "[Proposed fixes] Proposed fixes (in order of preference): (1) Skip continuation lines in the post-processor at store.py:298-303. Track scalar context while iterating raw_yaml.split('\\n'): any line whose first non-whitespace character continues a previously-opened double-quoted scalar must NOT receive the nonce comment append. ruamel guarantees indentation, so continuation lines are identifiable by their leading-whitespace + non-key prefix. (2) Force literal block scalars ('|') for description and other long fields via a custom ruamel.yaml representer — only effective combined with (1). (3) Raise ry.width to e.g. 1_000_000 to suppress folding for any realistic string. Cheapest immediate mitigation. (4) Belt-and-braces: combine (1) and (3)."  # 33f6
