  message: "[Tests to add] Tests to add: - Round-trip test: create an item with a description of 5000 UTF-8 bytes containing multi-byte characters (em-dashes, arrows, ≈, →, ★), verify show output matches input byte-for-byte. - Round-trip test: same for fields.<key> values of 5000 bytes. - Round-trip test: very long single-line descriptions (no embedded \\n) of 10000 bytes. - Adversarial test: literal user-supplied text containing patterns like '  # 1234' or '  # abcd' must survive round-trip without being mistaken for a nonce on the next read. - Regression test: create an item with the exact INV-gajap-as-of-2026-04-08 description after path correction (~4106 YAML bytes), verify byte-clean."  # 5ee2
